				<title>०७</title>
				<link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/maitrAyaNIyam/saMhitA/sarva-prastutiH/3/02/07/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
